flowchart TB
  U["Person in a browser"] --> APP
  GH["GitHub Actions keep-alive<br/>opens the app every 30 min"] -.-> APP
  subgraph APP["Streamlit app · ui/"]
    direction LR
    PAGES["Pages<br/>inbox · PO trail · edge cases · process · records"] --> ENG["engine.py<br/>FastAPI TestClient, in-process"]
  end
  APP -->|"in-process JSON, no network"| API
  subgraph API["FastAPI routes · api/"]
